              "title": "Tell me about yourself: LLMs are aware of their learned behaviors",
              "author": "Jan Betley, Xuchan Bao, Martín Soto, Anna Sztyber-Betley, James Chua, Owain Evans",
              "siteName": "arXiv.org",
              "category": "pdf",
              "language": "Engels",
              "readingTime": "1 hr 47 mins",
